WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.297
Area is the surface covered in square units. For a rectangle, multiply length by

00:00:05.297 --> 00:00:05.661
width.

00:00:06.533 --> 00:00:13.893
Find the area of a 11 cm by 9 cm rectangle. The answer is 99 cm squared . A equals l

00:00:13.893 --> 00:00:16.347
times w gives 99 cm squared .

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:22.975
A rectangular garden during a sports day measures 14 cm by 6 cm on a model. What is

00:00:22.975 --> 00:00:25.221
its area? Pause the video and think.

00:00:26.033 --> 00:00:32.074
A rectangular garden during a sports day measures 14 cm by 6 cm on a model. What is

00:00:32.074 --> 00:00:38.449
its area? The answer is 84 cm squared . A equals l times w gives 84 cm squared .
